      "review_description": "I am disappointed with the service provided by solahart bundaberg. I called to book for advertise $99 health check and was adviced and booked for $180 something service. The technician came, asked me to open the garage door and looked at the system and told me that we do not service this. Literally spent less than a minute telling me this. I get a bill for $99 per minute. Please avoid false advertising. Part of health check would  have been looking at panels and advising whether the invertor or panel need to replaced or both. On top of that i have lost the invoice now so I have to call. I feel cheated by false advertisement. Please avoid false advertisementPs: Owner replied to google review that $99 charge was call out fee and was not charge for health check of solar system. If it make sense than total cost of health check will be $198 and not $99 advertise since solarhart bundaberg will charge $99 for call out fee and $99 for health check. I still feel false advertisement since no where mention on their website that $99 extra will be charged for call out fee.",
